      "name": "fund_rewards",
      "docs": [
        "Top up the emissions pool. Permissionless: the team funds it at launch from",
        "the staking allocation, but anyone may add to it and nobody has a path to",
        "take anything back out.",
        "",
        "Funding extends how LONG emissions run, never how FAST. The rate is fixed."
      ],
