    {
      "name": "initialize_pool",
      "docs": [
        "Create the pool. `reward_rate_per_sec` is the EMISSIONS RATE: how many",
        "reward-token base units are released per second, split across all stakers",
        "by weighted stake. It is set once here and can NEVER be changed — there is",
        "no `set_reward_rate` instruction, deliberately.",
        "",
        "Emissions do not actually start until someone calls `fund_rewards`, which",
        "pushes `reward_end_time` forward by `amount / rate` seconds. The pool can",
        "therefore never promise more rewards than are physically in the vault."
      ],
